    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Am The Cat is a short, cosy narrative walking simulator, where you play as a little cat called Lily, and sometimes people tell you their problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features traditionally animated characters, all painted by hand in a 2.5D style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a completed hand-painted watercolour suburb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock over small objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find lost items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow at people</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allow yourself to get lost in the idyllic environments while you get to know the residents. Talk to the same characters throughout the week and learn more about them and their stories.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
